# recursive interpolation not allowed

Keluaran tulis: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Atur-cara ciri: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), baris-baharu.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Keluaran tulis: a, baris-baharu.


Atur-cara ciri: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] aktifkan: Benar.

